    "description": {
      "value": "You shine a ray of moonlight. Make a spell attack roll. The beam of light deals 2d6 fire damage. This is silver damage for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like.\n\nCritical Success: The beam deals double damage, and the target is dazzled for 1 minute.\nSuccess: The beam deals full damage, and the target is dazzled for 1 round."
    },
